name},\\n\\nThank you for your booking! Your reservation #{booking_id} for {room_name} (Room {room_number}) is now {status}.\\n\\nCheck-in: {check_in} from {check_in_time}\\nCheck-out: {check_out} by {check_out_time}\\nGuests: {guests} Adult(s), {children} Child(ren)\\n\\nIf you have any questions, please don\'t hesitate to contact us.\\n\\nBest regards,\\n{site_name}'=>'Dobrý den {customer_name},\\n\\nděkujeme za vaši rezervaci! Vaše rezervace č. {booking_id} pro pokoj {room_name} (Pokoj {room_number}) má nyní stav: {status}.\\n\\nPříjezd: {check_in} od {check_in_time}\\nOdjezd: {check_out} do {check_out_time}\\nHosté: {guests} dospělý(ch), {children} dítě/dětí\\n\\nV případě jakýchkoli dotazů nás neváhejte kontaktovat.\\n\\nS pozdravem,\\n{site_name}','Balance Collection Status'=>'Stav inkasa doplatku','Balance Collected Via'=>'Doplatek vybrán přes','Balance Payment Amount'=>'Částka platby doplatku','Balance Payment Date'=>'Datum platby doplatku','Balance Link Sent At'=>'Odkaz na doplatek odeslán dne','Urgent Unpaid'=>'Urgentně nezaplaceno','Payment History & Folio Ledger'=>'Historie plateb a hlavní kniha účtu','Amount Due Now'=>'Částka splatná nyní','Due Type'=>'Typ splatnosti','Additional charges pending payment'=>'Další poplatky čekající na úhradu','Offline Payment Methods in Payment Requests'=>'Offline platební metody v platebních požadavcích','Could not reach the license server, but your license was last verified %d hour(s) ago and remains active.'=>'Nelze se spojit s licenčním serverem, ale vaše licence byla naposledy ověřena před %d hodinou/hodinami a zůstává aktivní.','Displays the booking search and reservation form. Use [mhbo_booking_form] or [modern_hotel_booking].'=>'Zobrazí vyhledávací a rezervační formulář ubytování. Použijte [mhbo_booking_form] nebo [modern_hotel_booking].','Displays a grid of room types. Attributes: columns, limit.'=>'Zobrazí mřížku typů pokojů. Atributy: columns, limit.','Displays the availability calendar for a specific room. Attribute: room_id.'=>'Zobrazí kalendář dostupnosti pro konkrétní pokoj. Atribut: room_id.','Embeds the AI Concierge chat widget. Attributes: variant, position, welcome_message, theme.'=>'Vloží widget chatu AI recepčního. Atributy: variant, position, welcome_message, theme.','Available placeholders: {customer_name}, {customer_email}, {customer_phone}, {site_name}, {booking_id}, {booking_token}, {booking_reference}, {status}, {check_in}, {check_out}, {check_in_time}, {check_out_time}, {nights}, {total_price}, {guests}, {children}, {children_ages}, {children_total}, {room_name}, {room_number}, {custom_fields}, {booking_extras}, {extras}, {extras_text}, {payment_details}, {tax_breakdown}, {tax_breakdown_text}, {tax_total}, {tax_registration_number}, {company_name}, {company_address}, {company_phone}, {company_email}, {company_website}, {company_registration}, {whatsapp_number}, {whatsapp_link}, {view_url}, {special_requests}, {arrival_time}'=>'Dostupné zástupné symboly: {customer_name}, {customer_email}, {customer_phone}, {site_name}, {booking_id}, {booking_token}, {booking_reference}, {status}, {check_in}, {check_out}, {check_in_time}, {check_out_time}, {nights}, {total_price}, {guests}, {children}, {children_ages}, {children_total}, {room_name}, {room_number}, {custom_fields}, {booking_extras}, {extras}, {extras_text}, {payment_details}, {tax_breakdown}, {tax_breakdown_text}, {tax_total}, {tax_registration_number}, {company_name}, {company_address}, {company_phone}, {company_email}, {company_website}, {company_registration}, {whatsapp_number}, {whatsapp_link}, {view_url}, {special_requests}, {arrival_time}','Available placeholders: {customer_name}, {customer_email}, {customer_phone}, {site_name}, {booking_id}, {booking_token}, {booking_reference}, {status}, {check_in}, {check_out}, {check_in_time}, {check_out_time}, {nights}, {total_price}, {guests}, {children}, {children_ages}, {children_total}, {room_name}, {room_number}, {custom_fields}, {booking_extras}, {extras}, {